WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Three real Luna agents validate wait-regression and two baselines.

00:04.000 --> 00:12.000
Without Workcell, all three deploy into one shared binary slot.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
Two agents test somebody else’s binary and report false success.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
The control ends green but wrong: two false greens; only two candidates correct.

00:28.000 --> 00:40.000
The identical workload runs again. This time, Workcell owns deploy and test.

00:40.000 --> 00:48.000
One agent owns the slot. The others hold their places.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
wait-regression fails against its own binary, releases the lease, and is fixed off-lease.

01:00.000 --> 01:20.000
The repaired wait-regression candidate queues again and passes its own binary.

01:20.000 --> 01:27.000
Final: false greens 2 to 0; overlap 3 to 1; correct candidates 2/3 to 3/3.
